        "body": "December has 31 days. Three weeks are $7 \\times 3 = 21$ days, so Tom was awake $31 - 7 \\times 3$ days. A day has 24 hours and an hour has 60 minutes: $(31 - 7 \\times 3) \\times 24 \\times 60$.\n\n**Answer: (B)**"
