      {
        "title": "Total price",
        "body": "All bells together cost $1 + 2 + \\dots + 10 = 55$ euro. Three packages with the same price would each cost $55 \\div 3$, but 55 is not in the 3 times table ($3 \\times 18 = 54$). So it is impossible.\n\n**Answer: (E)**"
      },
