        "title": "Pairing trick for the sum",
        "body": "Pair 1 + 10, 2 + 9, 3 + 8, 4 + 7, 5 + 6: five pairs of 11 make 55. Since $5 + 5 = 10$ is not divisible by 3, 55 is not divisible by 3, so three equal packages are impossible.\n\n**Answer: (E)**"
