        "body": "Ana + Misha = 3 × Ana, and Dan eats the rest of 17.\n\n- Ana 3: Misha 6, Dan 8 — but Dan must eat less than Misha ✗\n- Ana 4: Misha 8, Dan 5 — more than 4, less than 8 ✓\n- Ana 5: Misha 10, Dan 2 — less than Ana ✗\n\n**Answer: (B) 5**"
